0..64 Comment "//! A module sealed by a signature, after ML\'s opaque ascription"
65..146 Comment "//! [Harper-1994-a_type_theoretic_approach_to_higher_order_modules_with_sharing]:"
147..222 Comment "//! outside the seal its type is abstract, so a value of it is reached only"
223..302 Comment "//! through the members the signature exposes. A run answering one is opaque at"
303..355 Comment "//! the seal, since its type is not marked `mobile`."
356..359 Comment "//!"
360..449 Comment "//! - cites: [Harper-1994-a_type_theoretic_approach_to_higher_order_modules_with_sharing]"
